    "body": "Some updates:\r\n\r\n- `QuantumCircuit` does not acutally need to be tested because internally everything builds up from the already tested evolutions in Terra\r\n- adaptivity should be supported now. Once we look at the algorithm stack I will update `AdaptVQE` accordingly\r\n- `succ_full`: it is fine if we only support `succ` for now. I know how to implement `succ_full` but it requires more time and a slightly different approach to `succ` because it not only needs to adapt the `excitation_list` but also the way the operators are constructed from them (see also #91)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
