    "body": "> Regarding `mp2info` I think it is straightforward to calculate from the excitation builder and the integrals. It should be kept attached to the UCCSD since the mp2 coeffs can be good approximations for initial guess of the cluster coefficients.\r\n\r\nTo clarify: I did not mean to outright remove it, merely to postpone it until a feature release in the future.\r\nWe discussed offline and agreed on doing exactly that.",
